  m_Name: text_gluttony_intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textId: gluttony_intro_fragment
  title: Fragment of Gluttony
  body: "Gluttony never asks what is needed, only what else can be taken.\nEvery feast it wins leaves the world thinner and the hunger sharper.\n\nThe tide restores what restraint is willing to spare."
